
  lcm install — Set up lcm for every harness on this machine: Claude Code (settings, MCP server, /memory skill, lcm.md, doctor) and, when `codex` is on PATH, the global Codex hooks. Reports one outcome per harness and exits non-zero on any failure.

  Usage: lcm install [--dry-run]

  Options:
    --dry-run  Preview all changes without writing anything, the shared core included

  Examples:
    lcm install            Run the full setup wizard
    lcm install --dry-run  Preview what install would do

